# GitHub practice

Before any commit, push, pull request, or merge, read and follow
`.cursor/skills/github-practice/SKILL.md`.

Justin authorized the full cycle in this repo. When he asks for a change to
the app, commit, push, open a draft, and squash-merge it once every gate in
that skill passes. Stop early when he names an earlier step, or when a gate
fails.

Never force-merge. Never bypass branch protection. Never merge a pull request
this task did not open. A failed or pending check blocks the merge.
